        <definition>uint64_t llvm::CachePruningPolicy::MaxSizeBytes</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>MaxSizeBytes</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::CachePruningPolicy::MaxSizeBytes</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= 0</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The maximum size for the cache directory in bytes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>A value over the amount of available space on the disk will be reduced to the amount of available space. A value of 0 disables the absolute size-based pruning. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
